<span id="A1.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">if PREVIOUS_SENTENCES is None</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.89)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.91em;--ltx-fo-height:5.48em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.23em;font-size:10pt;" height="78.87" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 75.76)" width="469.22"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.91em;">
<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You have an {SRC_LANG} sentence. Translate the sentence into {TGT_LANG}. Your translation must be surrounded by the <math id="A1.p1.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>TRANSLATION<math id="A1.p1.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p1.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>/TRANSLATION<math id="A1.p1.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> tags. Here’s the sentence to translate:

<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{SRC_SENTENCE}</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="177.85" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 177.85" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,177.85) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 171.94 C 0 175.2 2.64 177.85 5.91 177.85 L 471.47 177.85 C 474.73 177.85 477.38 175.2 477.38 171.94 L 477.38 5.91 C 477.38 2.64 474.73 0 471.47 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 153.58 L 475.41 153.58 L 475.41 5.91 C 475.41 3.73 473.65 1.97 471.47 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 162.26)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.37em;--ltx-fo-height:0.7em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.45" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.69)" width="434.07"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.37em;">
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">if PREVIOUS_SENTENCES is not None</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.89)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.91em;--ltx-fo-height:9.03em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.23em;font-size:10pt;" height="127.99" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 124.88)" width="469.22"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.91em;">
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Here’s a text snippet:

<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">{PREVIOUS_SENTENCES}

<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Using the snippet above as context, translate another sentence into {TGT_LANG}. Your translation must (1) be surrounded by the <math id="A1.p2.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>TRANSLATION<math id="A1.p2.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p2.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>/TRANSLATION<math id="A1.p2.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> tags and (2) contain nothing but the translation of the source sentence. Here’s the sentence for you to translate:

<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">{SRC_SENTENCE}</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Causal Alignment and WAIT Token Interleaving</h2>

<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Causal Alignment and <span id="alg1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">WAIT</span> Token Insertion</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> Source word timestamps <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X=\{(x_{i},s_{i},e_{i})\}_{i=1}^{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X=\{(x_{i},s_{i},e_{i})\}_{i=1}^{M}</annotation></semantics></math>, Target word sequence <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Y=\{y_{j}\}_{j=1}^{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Y=\{y_{j}\}_{j=1}^{N}</annotation></semantics></math>, Alignment <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f</annotation></semantics></math>, Decoder time dilation <math id="alg1.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math>, Decoder context length <math id="alg1.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l=1500/D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1500</mn><mo>/</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l=1500/D</annotation></semantics></math>, Token duration (ms) <math id="alg1.l1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta t=30000/l" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>30000</mn><mo>/</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta t=30000/l</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> Augmented target labels <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L\in\{0,\dots,V\}^{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mi>l</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L\in\{0,\dots,V\}^{l}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           Initialize <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L\leftarrow[\omega,\omega,\dots,\omega]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ω</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ω</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L\leftarrow[\omega,\omega,\dots,\omega]</annotation></semantics></math> {Initialize with <span id="alg1.l3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">WAIT</span> tokens}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P\leftarrow\text{get\_prompt\_tokens}(\text{lang, task})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>get_prompt_tokens</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>lang, task</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P\leftarrow\text{get\_prompt\_tokens}(\text{lang, task})</annotation></semantics></math> {Prepend task/language markers}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">to</span> <math id="alg1.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|P|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|P|</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L[k]\leftarrow P[k]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L[k]\leftarrow P[k]</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{last}\leftarrow|P|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{last}\leftarrow|P|</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j=1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">to</span> <math id="alg1.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l9.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(j)=i\neq\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(j)=i\neq\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
             {Aligned: Calculate index based on audio timestamp}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
             <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta\sim\mathcal{U}(0,200)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0,200</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta\sim\mathcal{U}(0,200)</annotation></semantics></math> {Sample stochastic delay}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
             <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{target}\leftarrow\lceil(e_{i}+\delta)/\Delta t\rceil" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌈</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{target}\leftarrow\lceil(e_{i}+\delta)/\Delta t\rceil</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l14.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else</span>


</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
             {Unaligned: Defer to the next available logical time}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
             <math id="alg1.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{target}\leftarrow t_{last}+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{target}\leftarrow t_{last}+1</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l17.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l17.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            {Ensure monotonic emission and handle potential collisions}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{start}\leftarrow\max(t_{target},t_{last}+1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{start}\leftarrow\max(t_{target},t_{last}+1)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{tokens}\leftarrow\text{tokenize}(y_{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>tokens</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>tokenize</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{tokens}\leftarrow\text{tokenize}(y_{j})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau\in\text{tokens}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>tokens</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau\in\text{tokens}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
             <span id="alg1.l22.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{start}&lt;l" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{start}&lt;l</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l22.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l23" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
              <math id="alg1.l23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L[t_{start}]\leftarrow\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L[t_{start}]\leftarrow\tau</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l24" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
              <math id="alg1.l24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{last}\leftarrow t_{start}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{last}\leftarrow t_{start}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l25" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
              <math id="alg1.l25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{start}\leftarrow t_{start}+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{start}\leftarrow t_{start}+1</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l26" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
             <span id="alg1.l26.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l26.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l27" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l27.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l27.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l28" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l28.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l28.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l29" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l29.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg1.l29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Extended Ablation Studies: Model Size and Encoder Variants</h2>

<section id="A3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.1 </span>Scaling Performance with Hikari-small</h3>

<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">While Hikari-medium establishes a strong baseline, we investigated if similar performance could be achieved with fewer parameters using Hikari-small. Despite following the same training and SFT recipe, the smaller model frequently failed to stabilize within standard latency envelopes (e.g., under 5s for en-ja). As shown in Table <a href="#A3.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ C.1 Scaling Performance with Hikari-small ‣ Appendix C Extended Ablation Studies: Model Size and Encoder Variants ‣ Streaming Translation and Transcription Through Speech-to-Text Causal Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, achieving meaningful measurements required relaxing the evaluation threshold to 6s StreamLAAL. This performance degradation highlights that sufficient decoder depth is critical for the model to internalize the implicit READ/WRITE policy without external guidance.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Translation performance of Hikari-small. StreamLAAL CA is shown in brackets. Best BLEU scores are shown for StreamLAAL under 4 s. Average difference represents the mean change in BLEU and StreamLAAL across evaluated latency regimes.</figcaption>
